flowchart TB
 Q[按 FIFO 读取已确认需求]:::truth
 C[分类／任务匹配／资源准入]:::truth
 B[绑定真实 task／requirement／operation<br/>消费提交与 pre-author 责任提交]:::truth
 P[绑定可替换执行 Provider<br/>独立协议与 readiness]:::truth
 A[启动作者并提交业务输入]:::truth
 R[读取精确完成响应与合法计划]:::truth
 S[收拢作者<br/>身份／资源释放／持久化／证据]:::truth
 J[提交作者 outcome 到 Organ Journal]:::truth
 V[decision-ready 且 closed<br/>发布 TaskPlan 并提交 Journal]:::truth
 D[派发根 operation]:::truth
 Q --> C --> B --> P --> A --> R --> S --> J
 J -->|闭合且有效| V --> D
 J -->|失败／未知| U[保留 created 与恢复责任<br/>不直接派发]:::truth
 F[当前偏离：无消费的 capability 查询<br/>实际阻断作者启动]:::gap
 P -.->|现状偏离标注，非必要业务节点| F
 F -.->|现场未启动，author unknown| U

classDef truth fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#1d4ed8,color:#1e3a8a,stroke-width:2px;
classDef derived fill:#e0f2fe,stroke:#0284c7,color:#0c4a6e;
classDef design fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706,color:#78350f,stroke-dasharray:5 3;
classDef gap fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#dc2626,color:#7f1d1d,stroke-width:2px;
classDef evidence fill:#f1f5f9,stroke:#64748b,color:#334155;

